Package: corei-kafka
Version: @VERSION@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: COREI OS <noreply@coreeyegroup.github.io>
Depends: openjdk-21-jre-headless | openjdk-17-jre-headless, adduser, curl, ca-certificates
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://kafka.apache.org/
Description: Apache Kafka @KAFKA_VERSION@ (KRaft, single node) packaged for COREI OS
 Downloads the official Apache Kafka @KAFKA_VERSION@ release (Apache License 2.0)
 at install time and refuses it unless its SHA-512 matches the value verified
 against Apache's signed release at build time. Provides a localhost-only
 single-node KRaft configuration and a systemd service.
 For production clusters with replication, use a dedicated Kafka deployment.
